@startuml 20-tp-failsafe-injection-map
' ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
' Diagram 20: Failsafe Test Injection Points on Mission FSM
' Shows where each SITL failsafe test injects a fault
' MC-TP-001 §6  TP-ST-002 through TP-ST-006, TP-ST-010
' ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

title "20 — Failsafe Test Injection Points\nSITL Fault Injection on Mission Phase FSM  ·  MC-TP-001 §6\n<color:#C02020>Design target — only TP-ST-003/002/006 are actually implemented (test_10a/b/c), see notes</color>"

skinparam BackgroundColor #FAFBFC
skinparam DefaultFontColor #1C2334
skinparam DefaultFontSize 10
skinparam TitleFontSize 13
skinparam TitleFontStyle bold
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam RoundCorner 8

skinparam state {
  BackgroundColor #D8E8F8
  BorderColor #3D5A80
  BorderThickness 1.5
  FontSize 10
  FontStyle bold
  ArrowColor #3D5A80
  ArrowFontSize 9
  ArrowFontColor #2A4060
  StartColor #1A3860
  EndColor #1A3860
}

skinparam note {
  BackgroundColor #FFFAE8
  BorderColor #C09030
  FontSize 9
}

' ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════
' MISSION PHASE FSM
' ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════
[*] --> PREFLIGHT

PREFLIGHT : Pre-arm checks
PREFLIGHT --> ARMING : GCS ARM_AUTHORISE\n+ checks pass

ARMING : FCC arming sequence
ARMING --> TAKEOFF : arming_state = ARMED

TAKEOFF : FCC AUTO_TAKEOFF
TAKEOFF --> INGRESS : altitude reached\n+ GCS INGRESS cmd

INGRESS : Formation keeping\nto muster waypoint
INGRESS --> MUSTER : FCC mission item\ncomplete

MUSTER : Formation hold\nPeer state exchange
MUSTER --> ISR_SELECTION : quorum met

state ISR_SELECTION #FFE8C0
ISR_SELECTION : Coordinator election\nScoring · ISR_RESULT
ISR_SELECTION --> VORONOI_PARTITION : all ACKs received

state VORONOI_PARTITION #FFE8C0
VORONOI_PARTITION : Fortune's algorithm\nConsensus protocol
VORONOI_PARTITION --> SEARCH : consensus OK\n+ path uploaded

state SEARCH #C8E8C8
SEARCH : AUTO_MISSION\nCoverage path\nDetection active
SEARCH --> RETURN : GCS END_MISSION\nor mission complete

RETURN : AUTO_RTL
RETURN --> LAND : at home point

LAND : AUTO_LAND
LAND --> [*] : disarmed

state FAULT #FFD0D0
FAULT : RTL or HOLD\nGCS notified
FAULT --> [*] : disarmed

' ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════
' NOMINAL ABORT
' ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════
SEARCH --> FAULT : GCS ABORT (any phase)
INGRESS --> FAULT : GCS ABORT
MUSTER --> FAULT : GCS ABORT

' ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════
' FAULT INJECTION ANNOTATIONS
' ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════

note right of SEARCH #FFE0E0
  <b>Fault Injection Points</b> (design target;
  actual status noted per test — 2026-09-08):
  ─────────────────────────
  <b>TP-ST-002</b>  GCS Link Loss — IMPLEMENTED
  (test_10b), but NOT phase-gated as drawn:
  the real test withholds MAVLink heartbeats and
  asserts only /mc/gcs/link_status flips false
  then true on recovery. There is no HOLD state —
  mission_manager_node does not change mission_phase
  on GCS loss at all (SDD-MC-001.md §10.3's own
  documented gap). No iptables used (native process,
  not a container).
  ─────────────────────────
  <b>TP-ST-003</b>  Low Battery RTL — PARTIALLY
  IMPLEMENTED (test_10a): real PX4-side failure
  injection (MAV_CMD_INJECT_FAILURE via PX4's own
  MAVLink port, not a spoofed BATTERY_STATUS frame).
  Only asserts health_monitor_node publishes
  FaultEvent.LOW_BATTERY — does NOT assert
  nav_state=AUTO_RTL or a STATUSTEXT WARN (mission
  RTL response is untested here; SEARCH phase itself
  is unreachable, see diagram 19's status note).
  ─────────────────────────
  <b>TP-ST-004</b>  Manager Crash — NOT IMPLEMENTED.
  No Docker in this test harness, so no
  "docker kill mc-mission-exec"; watchdog-restart
  behavior is untested by TEST-002.
  ─────────────────────────
  <b>TP-ST-005</b>  Peer Drone Lost — NOT IMPLEMENTED.
  No second drone instance ever runs; re-partition
  on peer loss is untested by TEST-002.
  ─────────────────────────
  <b>TP-ST-006</b>  FCC Comms Lost — IMPLEMENTED
  (test_10c): real `pkill` on the shared PX4 SITL
  process (not "docker kill mc-fcc-bridge" — no
  Docker here). Asserts FaultEvent.FCC_LINK_LOST
  published. Destructive — runs last.
end note

note left of ISR_SELECTION #FFE0E0
  <b>TP-ST-010</b>  Coordinator Failover — NOT
  IMPLEMENTED. No second drone instance ever runs,
  and swarm_coordinator_node itself is still a
  scaffold (mock_swarm_coord_node stands in) —
  real coordinator election/failover is untested
  by TEST-002.
end note

note left of PREFLIGHT #FFE8CC
  <b>TP-UT-011</b>  Pre-arm Check
  (unit test, no SITL)
  Inject: battery_remaining = 0.28
  Assert: pre_arm_checks() = false
  Assert: ARMING not entered
end note

note right of FAULT #FFD0D0
  <b>Design target: all failsafe tests</b>
  <b>ultimately resolve through this state.</b>
  ─────────────────────────
  TP-ST-003: Low battery → RTL → LAND (design;
    test_10a only asserts the fault event, not this path)
  TP-ST-004 (ext.): 3× crash → RTL (not implemented)
  TP-ST-006: FCC lost → FAULT declared (test_10c
    asserts the fault event; does not further confirm
    mission_manager_node's own phase transition here)
  ─────────────────────────
  S1 severity: any failsafe that does
  NOT reach expected safe state.
end note

' ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════
' EXPECTED OUTCOMES LEGEND
' ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════
legend right
  | Test | Design: Phase | Design: Fault | Design: Outcome | <b>Actual (2026-09-08)</b> |
  | <b>TP-ST-002</b> | SEARCH | GCS link DROP | HOLD until recovery | test_10b: implemented, phase-independent; asserts link_status only, no HOLD state exists |
  | <b>TP-ST-003</b> | SEARCH | battery = 18% | RTL immediately | test_10a: implemented (real PX4 failure injection); asserts LOW_BATTERY fault only, not RTL |
  | <b>TP-ST-004</b> | SEARCH | manager kill | restart < 15 s; HOLD | NOT IMPLEMENTED — no Docker in this harness |
  | <b>TP-ST-004 ext.</b> | SEARCH | 3× manager kill | RTL; MANAGER_DEAD | NOT IMPLEMENTED |
  | <b>TP-ST-005</b> | SEARCH | peer MC stop | re-partition → new path | NOT IMPLEMENTED — single-drone harness |
  | <b>TP-ST-006</b> | SEARCH | fcc-bridge kill | FAULT; STATUSTEXT CRITICAL | test_10c: implemented as `pkill` on PX4 SITL; asserts FCC_LINK_LOST fault |
  | <b>TP-ST-010</b> | ISR_SELECTION | coordinator kill | Drone 2 takes over | NOT IMPLEMENTED — single-drone harness, swarm_coord still a scaffold |
endlegend

@enduml
